# The readability article: `the name of person` reads `name of person`.
address has city "Oslo"
person has name "Ada", age 36, address address
say the name of person
say The name of person
the age of person is 37
say the age of person
say the city of the address of person
say the city of address of the person
say length of the name of person
say uppercase of the name of person
nameText is the name of person
say length of the nameText
older is the age of person plus 1
say older
if the age of person is at least 18
    say "adult"
if the name of person contains "A" and the age of person is 37
    say "both"
items are
    "x"
    "y"
say first of the items
say last of the items

# Elsewhere `the` is an ordinary name.
the is "article"
say the
say the "and" the
holder has the "property called the"
say the of holder
the of holder is "changed"
say the of holder

# Two-word properties take the article too.
result has name "r"
try
    say the exit code of result
otherwise into reason
    say reason

doc is xml from text "<library><book id=\"1\">Dune</book></library>"
book is element "book" in the doc
say text of the book
say attribute "id" of the book
set attribute "id" of the book to "2"
say attribute "id" of book
set text of the book to "Emma"
say text of book
if element "book" exists in the doc
    say "found"

the city of the address of person is "Bergen"
say city of address of person
try
    the name of nobody is "x"
otherwise into reason
    say reason
